==Trivia==
* The five variants of jungle horror are functionally identical, but have slightly different sizes and appearances. Their names as defined in the game's source code suggest they perform different roles in jungle horror society: <code>harmless_island_jungle_horror_worker</code>, <code>...young_worker</code>, <code>...warrior</code>, <code>...young_warrior</code>, and <code>...guard</code>.
* The warrior variants appear to have spikes on their back as well as a spike (or possibly a beard) on their chins.

